WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.900
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and a lot of
you requested I do a video for the Batman

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.430
vs Superman comic con trailer so that’s
what this video will be. I know a lot of you

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.700
Deadpool people were way more excited about
that clip and everyone assumes Marvel is the

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.330
big event of the weekend. But just looking
at the raw number of mentions on social media.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.449
Batman vs Superman was the most talked about
thing this weekend. And it wasn’t even a

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:24.500
trailer. It was a super short clip without
any dialogue.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.410
But in case you're just finding me or because
of all the comic con craziness I do Marvel

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.930
and DC videos every week. Be sure to subscribe
to get everything.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:36.870
The clip was something right out of a Frank
Miller panel. It was Batman in Gotham on a

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:41.660
rooftop. It’s raining really hard and he
draws the cover off the bat signal. Lightning

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:46.160
Strikes and Superman is there in the air with
glowing red eyes.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:52.170
Then it cuts to Batman who’s wearing a heavy
armor suit. Like you see in Dark Knight Returns

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.579
with glowing white eyes. They don’t speak.

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:59.980
There was an image of Gal Gadot, this hi res
one they released officially while the panel

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:06.980
was going on. She wasn’t in gotham for that
scene. It’s was just like a clip cropped

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:10.909
on one side of the screen and her image on
the other.

00:01:10.909 --> 00:01:15.670
It was a little weird. In Hall H if you’ve
never been. It’s got these giant walls.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:20.130
So studios can roll out extra viewing screens
that kind of wrap around the audience. It’s

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:25.560
just so everyone can see better. There have
always been big screens hanging from the ceiling

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.009
in several rows.

00:01:26.009 --> 00:01:28.869
But everyone kind of knew something weird
was going on when they rolled out all these

00:01:28.869 --> 00:01:35.869
screens. And just to be clear. This wasn’t
a Batman vs Superman panel. It was a 90 minute

00:01:36.259 --> 00:01:41.179
Warner Brothers panel during which the talked
about several movies. Batman vs Superman was

00:01:41.179 --> 00:01:42.139
just the first one.

00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:46.899
If you didn’t see it already I posted the
panel footage. It was super short. Zack Snyder

00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:53.749
came out and introduced the clip and the holy
trinity. The funny thing is he told the organizers

00:01:53.749 --> 00:01:58.090
not to give them mics. Like he didn’t want
Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill or Gal Gadot to

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.759
speak. I laughed a little.

00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:03.539
It’s not for any super secret reason. He
probably just thought their presentation would

00:02:03.539 --> 00:02:05.319
be more effective if they didn’t speak or
answer questions.

00:02:05.319 --> 00:02:08.140
They’re still right in the middle of filming
so they actually had to stop production to

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:13.129
fly the actors in and then fly them right
back right away. Production delays are expensive

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:18.489
because they still have to pay the crew. So
bringing those three actors to comic con for

00:02:18.489 --> 00:02:23.150
a two minute Chris Hardwick selfie probably
cost a half a million dollars.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:30.150
I saw a lot of people commenting that Batman
Ben Affleck that is was taller than Henry

00:02:34.989 --> 00:02:40.030
Cavill. I guess feeling like Superman should
be taller. But that’s just actors. Most

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:45.730
actors in general are pretty short. But leading
men, like A-List $150 Million Dollar movie

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:50.879
leading men tend to all be over 6 feet. Minimum.

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:55.560
Ben Affleck is 6’4” so he’s super tall.
Henry Cavill is 6’1”. In the movie I think

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:59.469
they’ll be made to look like equals. Not
counting the extra inches Ben Affleck gets

00:02:59.469 --> 00:03:03.620
from the ears on his cowl. But they shortened
those to look more like the Frank Miller versions.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:10.620
So for those going crazy, when they’re standing
on the ground next to each other. They’ll

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.420
be eye to eye. It just makes for better tension.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.569
I’ve already talked a lot about the rumored
story arc. Of their relationship that is,

00:03:17.569 --> 00:03:22.099
but since a lot of you guys are new to my
channel I’ll say it again.

00:03:22.099 --> 00:03:28.290
The rumors are saying that Batman is pissed
at Superman for being a bull in a china shop.

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:33.430
So Superman is treated by Batman and the other
heroes of the world as an alien. The movie’s

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:37.909
subtitle is Dawn of Justice as in Dawn of
Justice League. So presumably during the course

00:03:37.909 --> 00:03:40.739
of events Superman will win Batman’s trust.

00:03:40.739 --> 00:03:47.739
This doesn’t really address Gal Gadot’s
role as Wonder Woman or Cyborg or Aquaman.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:55.239
I know Jason Momoa was rumored for the role.
But nothing has been confirmed. It all ties

00:03:55.239 --> 00:03:59.670
in with the idea that Superman’s battle
with Zod destroyed half the planet. Mostly

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:04.269
damage done by those world engines. So the
earth’s heroes call on him to answer for

00:04:04.269 --> 00:04:07.670
what he’s done.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.609
That could be what that Bat signal scene was
all about. We saw it out of context, but it

00:04:10.609 --> 00:04:13.859
could be the moment when Batman calls Superman
out for the first time. It would definitely

00:04:13.859 --> 00:04:19.449
explain why the pictures they showed of both
of them made them look so angry.

00:04:19.449 --> 00:04:26.449
Cyborg’s role is also a big mystery as is
the other villains besides Lex Luthor. We

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:35.360
do know that Lexcorp is going to be a tech
company a la Facebook or Google. But since

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.960
we don’t know if they’re a software giant
or a hardware giant I can’t tie Cyborg to

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:43.479
them. Cyborg is usually tied to Star Labs
in the comics. During the first Man of Steel

00:04:43.479 --> 00:04:47.569
movie, they had a STAR Labs easter egg during
the military base scenes. The logo was just

00:04:47.569 --> 00:04:49.419
playing on the screens in the background.

00:04:49.419 --> 00:04:54.870
So I’m guessing when the heroes of the world
start to rally against Superman, the military

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.720
throws their hat in the ring too, being Cyborg
via military funded Star Labs tech.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:01.819
The other rumored villains include Morgan
Edge. In the comics he’s a ruthless media

00:05:01.819 --> 00:05:04.979
mogul who owns the Daily Planet along with
a bunch of other media companies. He’s like

00:05:04.979 --> 00:05:10.819
a Rupert Murdoch figure. Before the new 52
reboot he was also leader of Intergang.

00:05:10.819 --> 00:05:14.629
Victor Zasz, who’s just a really freaky
serial killer that tattoos himself every time

00:05:14.629 --> 00:05:16.139
he kills someone.

00:05:16.139 --> 00:05:23.139
David Cain, who’s another mercenary affiliated
with the league of assassins and Amanda Waller.

00:05:25.669 --> 00:05:32.669
Those characters aren’t confirmed. But they’re
the best rumors we’ve heard so far.

00:05:33.759 --> 00:05:40.759
If you’ve been watching Arrow then you’ve
seen Cynthia Addai Robinson playing Waller.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:51.080
On that show she’s leading ARGUS and even
though Bruce Wayne does exist in the tv universe,

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:56.310
she’s never referenced him or anyone else
outside of the characters Arrow is using.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:01.909
Geoff Johns actually laid the whole Movie
and TV shared universe thing to rest at Comic

00:06:01.909 --> 00:06:04.090
Con. He said that TV and Film shall be separate,
for the foreseeable future. That means you

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.930
should not expect to see any of the tv actors
in any of the films. Or see any of the storylines

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:07.800
crossover from tv to film.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.300
But Stephen Amell said this really cool thing.
On Television, because they have all these

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.810
amazing characters going this fall. You’ll
basically be getting the Justice League every

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.460
single week. And I definitely agree. I don’t
mind treating the movies and the tv shows

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.009
as alternate universes.

00:06:23.009 --> 00:06:28.919
That doesn’t mean it’s always going to
be like that, but don’t plan on it anytime

00:06:28.919 --> 00:06:29.349
soon.

00:06:29.349 --> 00:06:35.699
There was this funny moment when someone asked
Stephen Amell who he wanted to play Bruce

00:06:35.699 --> 00:06:42.610
Wayne in the Arrow verse and he said Robbie
Amell. This was before he was cast as Firestorm

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:48.500
on The Flash. The fact that they’re related
makes watching these shows that much more

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:48.710
meta.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.500
Warner Brothers hasn’t made any indication
it’s going to release the Comic Con clip

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:58.500
although a version of it did leak last week.
So some of may have seen it. But I’ll keep

00:07:04.879 --> 00:07:09.330
doing bonus videos for the movie whenever
new things happen. Most of my DC videos are

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:15.520
going to be for the TV Shows this fall. There
are going to be six total. Which is crazy.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:22.520
There’s Arrow Season 3, then five new shows
including The Flash, Gotham, Constantine,

00:07:25.539 --> 00:07:32.539
iZombie and Preacher. Preacher is going to
be on AMC and won’t premiere until 2015.

00:07:34.169 --> 00:07:37.530
Gotham is FOX and Constantine is NBC, all
the others are CW.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:44.530
They haven’t completely ruled out Gotham
crossovers with Arrow and the Flash, but I’m

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:51.530
not expecting it. The showrunner for that
said Gotham existed in an alternate universe

00:07:52.699 --> 00:07:54.340
from the other DC Shows.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:08:00.750
I know I owe you guys a review of Gotham and
Constantine, but since I’m behind and most

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:04.719
of you haven’t seen those shows. I might
just wait till they actually premiere.

00:08:04.719 --> 00:08:11.719
I’ll tell you what though. If you still
want me to do reviews for them leave a comment

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.870
saying so and click the like button. If this
video gets more than 2 thousand likes before

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.500
